00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:05.932
(laughs)

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:09.277
(Filipino Tinikling music playing)

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.001
- Whoa!

00:00:33.882 --> 00:00:34.825
I like this.

