ladders in football.

00:00:48.319 --> 00:00:50.069
- I know how to do the
Electric Slide, you know?

00:00:51.989 --> 00:00:53.387
- How hard can it be?

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:55.692
- Do people get hurt a lot
when they first try this?

00:00:55.692 --> 00:00:56.229
- Uh...

00:00:56.229 --> 00:00:58.105
- No?

00:00:58.105 --> 00:00:58.438
Yes.

00:00:58.438 --> 00:01:00.208
Okay, he nodded yes.

00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:01.043
(laughs)

00:01:01.043 --> 00:01:01.984
- Do you wanna hold my hand?

00:01:01.984 --> 00:01:02.876
- Not really.

00:01:02.876 --> 00:01:03.737
- Shut up!
(laughs)

00:01:03.737 --> 00:01:04.924
Just hold my hand!

00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:07.844
- You're slamming very strong,
like there's a lot of power.

00:01:07.844 --> 00:01:09.767
- Seems like with an intent.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:11.715
- Ahh!

00:01:11.715 --> 00:01:12.994
- Let's go.

00:01:14.752 --> 00:01:15.673
- Ah!

00:01:15.673 --> 00:01:16.602
- Ready, go.

00:01:19.193 --> 00:01:20.623
- Ah (beep)!

00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:21.301
- Rhythm!

00:01:21.301 --> 00:01:22.480
- Ahh!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.112
- Oh, my god!

00:01:24.112 --> 00:01:25.662
