00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:40.772
- People who can do this are a genius.

00:01:40.772 --> 00:01:42.393
- That's (beep) Filipinos, man.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:43.085
Okay?

00:01:43.085 --> 00:01:44.107
- I'm scared, I don't like it!

00:01:44.107 --> 00:01:44.756
(laughs)

00:01:44.756 --> 00:01:45.697
I'm scared!

00:01:45.697 --> 00:01:46.837
- Did I do it?

00:01:46.837 --> 00:01:48.055
Was I doing it?

00:01:50.962 --> 00:01:52.555
- I think I was better when I was drunk.

00:01:52.555 --> 00:01:54.503
Like I don't know how
that's even possible.

00:01:54.503 --> 00:01:56.186
- Clap, clap, clap, clap.

00:01:58.209 --> 00:02:00.178
