00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:03.619
Freestyle.

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.776
Oh god.

00:02:06.115 --> 00:02:06.970
(laughs)

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:07.824
- Ready?

00:02:07.824 --> 00:02:09.103
Ready?

00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:11.051
- Why'd you hit me?

00:02:11.051 --> 00:02:12.142
I didn't even get in!

00:02:12.142 --> 00:02:13.565
