00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:16.299
But I think with a little bit of practice,

00:02:16.299 --> 00:02:17.590
it's pretty fun actually.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.299
- I feel you have to
be one with the bamboo.

00:02:19.299 --> 00:02:21.253
- Yeah, you have to be
totally one with the bamboo.

00:02:21.253 --> 00:02:22.424
