00:02:23.279 --> 00:02:24.363
- They're hardcore, for sure.

00:02:24.363 --> 00:02:25.231
- They're (beep) hardcore.

00:02:25.231 --> 00:02:27.961
Even their simple ceremonial
dances could kill you.

00:02:27.961 --> 00:02:29.754
This dance could kill you.

00:02:29.754 --> 00:02:32.243
And they have children doing it.

00:02:33.743 --> 00:02:34.857
It could kill you.

00:02:34.857 --> 00:02:36.410
